---
---

<section class="terminal-hero">
  <div class="terminal-window">
    <div class="terminal-header">
      <span class="terminal-dot terminal-dot--red"></span>
      <span class="terminal-dot terminal-dot--amber"></span>
      <span class="terminal-dot terminal-dot--green"></span>
      <span class="terminal-title">bash — portfolio</span>
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-body">
      <div class="terminal-line">
        <span class="prompt">$</span>
        <span class="command">whoami</span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-line terminal-line--output">
        <span class="output">backend engineer · arquitectura · sistemas distribuidos</span>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal-line">
        <span class="prompt">$</span>
        <span class="command">ls <span class="arg">~/projects/</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-line terminal-line--output">
        <span class="output">
          <a href="/projects/infotec" class="output-link">infotec</a>
          <a href="/projects/happyguest" class="output-link">happyguest</a>
          <a href="/projects/derby" class="output-link">derby</a>
          <a href="/projects/belieff" class="output-link">belieff</a>
          <a href="/projects/adc" class="output-link">adc</a>
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal-line">
        <span class="prompt">$</span>
        <span class="command">cat <span class="arg">~/manifesto.txt</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-line terminal-line--output">
        <pre class="manifesto">
Diseño sistemas, no features.
Mido resultados, no líneas de código.
Automatizo lo repetible, documento lo complejo.</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal-line terminal-line--bottom">
        <span class="prompt">$</span>
        <span class="command">./status <span class="arg">--live</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-line terminal-line--output">
        <span class="output output--live">disponible para proyectos · latam · remoto</span>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal-line terminal-line--cursor">
        <span class="prompt">$</span>
        <span class="cursor" aria-hidden="true">▊</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .terminal-hero {
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--content-padding) var(--space-lg);
    max-width: var(--content-max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .terminal-window {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    overflow: hidden;
    font-family: var(--font-mono-stack);
  }

  .terminal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    background-color: var(--color-bg-tertiary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .terminal-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .terminal-dot--red { background-color: #ff5f56; }
  .terminal-dot--amber { background-color: #ffbd2e; }
  .terminal-dot--green { background-color: #27c93f; }

  .terminal-title {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .terminal-body {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .terminal-line {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .terminal-line--output {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
    padding-left: calc(1.5ch + var(--space-sm));
  }

  .terminal-line--bottom {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .terminal-line--cursor {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .prompt {
    color: var(--hero-prompt-color);
    user-select: none;
  }

  .command {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .arg {
    color: var(--color-terminal-cyan);
  }

  .output {
    color: var(--hero-text-color);
  }

  .output--live {
    color: var(--color-terminal-green);
  }

  .output-link {
    color: var(--color-text-link);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-right: var(--space-sm);
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .output-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .manifesto {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono-stack);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    line-height: var(--line-height-relaxed);
    color: var(--hero-text-color);
    white-space: pre;
  }

  .cursor {
    color: var(--hero-cursor-color);
    animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
  }

  @keyframes blink {
    50% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .terminal-body {
      padding: var(--space-md);
    }

    .manifesto {
      font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    }

    .terminal-line {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .terminal-line--output {
      padding-left: calc(1.5ch + var(--space-sm));
    }
  }
</style>
